; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (RFC4005.dadx#aar-auth-application-id-nasreq)
; AVP: Auth-Application-Id
; Command: AA-Request
; Section: 1.3
; Page: 6
"Diameter applications conforming to this specification MUST advertise support by including the value of one (1) in the Auth-Application-Id of Capabilities-Exchange-Request (CER), AA-Request (AAR), and AA-Answer (AAA) messages."
    range 1


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (RFC4005.dadx#aaa-auth-application-id-nasreq)
; AVP: Auth-Application-Id
; Command: AA-Answer
; Section: 1.3
; Page: 6
"Diameter applications conforming to this specification MUST advertise support by including the value of one (1) in the Auth-Application-Id of Capabilities-Exchange-Request (CER), AA-Request (AAR), and AA-Answer (AAA) messages."
    range 1


